  "contract": [
    "Spell.dbc 680544 promises that main-hand attacks apply Purity 681413 and off-hand attacks apply",
    "Wickedness 681523, up to six stacks, and that Torchlight 503662 consumes them to deal one amount of",
    "Holyflame 681415 or Shadowstrike 681524 damage (owner ruling O-24: all stacks of both types consumed, one",
    "hit, helper chosen 50/50, amplified by the consumed stacks). Normal dual-wield attacks must build both",
    "auras, a normal Torchlight must remove both and deal one bonus hit of more than 500 (one amount is 1028 plus",
    "the scaling terms before modifiers), and a second Torchlight without more auto attacks must produce no",
    "helper. The single helper is read as the Shadowstrike count relative to the negated Holyflame count (the",
    "hunter's Holyflame count on itself, 0, relative to the Holyflame count); both start at 0."
